  "description": "<p><strong>Brand introduction:</strong><br>We're a new company selling easy &amp; fast data only travel eSIMs</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product description:</strong><br>Data only travel eSIMs that help save money when you have to pay for roaming<br><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>Fast, easy and they just work - no complicated forms, no apps to download, no faff. Place an order, get an email a few seconds later, scan the QR code and you're good to go. Sounds straightforward, but after travelling and experiencing other eSIM companies - this isn't always the case.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When you have to pay to use data abroad, we're almost always cheaper. There's no daily costs to access data either. Just pay for an amount or duration and use as you need.<br><br><strong>Payment terms:</strong><br>Monthly - 1st of each month.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Happy to answer any questions you have</li>\r\n<li>If you have a sizeable channel, happy to provide a tester/discount</li>\r\n</ul>",
